Rule 5 (Shape of input tensor 'a' must be a tuple of integers, and its length must be greater than or equal to 2)
{a : tensor} |= if ndim(a) ≥ 2 then true else false
>>
Rule 6 (a: tensor, conjugate: bool. if conjugate is true, dtype of a must be complex)
{a : tensor, conjugate : bool} |= if conjugate = true then (dtype_(a) = 10 ∨ dtype_(a) = 11)
