Rule 10 (Prevent shape error when rank is 0)
{a : tensor} |= ndim(a) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 12 (Preventing ValueError when input tensor is a vector)
{a : tensor} |= ndim(a) > 1
>>
Rule 14 (Prevent shape error with a bool tensor. If tensor is boolean, shape must be greater than 1)
